Subject: [PATCH 11/12] =?UTF-8?q?SystemUI:=20icon-only=20keys=20in=20the?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20Bud=C3=ADk=20control=20centre?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Like the iOS control centre the keys carry no cut labels: the six small
keys show only the icon (state = fill), the large keys show their name
only when it fits without an ellipsis. The name and state stay available
to TalkBack, and tapping a network tile (internet, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth,
mobile data, hotspot, cast) names it with its state in the header for
three seconds. Small keys are 52 dp tall (touch target >= 48 dp).
